{"id":"n68625-1-9","stage":5,"title":"온수 · 温水","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68625-1-9-1","ko":"밖이 너무 추워서 손이 꽁꽁 얼었어.","zh":"外面太冷了，我的手都冻僵了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밖이","meaning":"外面，外边","explanation":"밖：外面，外边；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"4","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밖이","audio":"/audio/8938a3055438c4e2bd60.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"추워서","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"1","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"추워서","audio":"/audio/0b67ec971d5347edda2f.mp3"}},{"text":"손이","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손이","audio":"/audio/7bcb7cea5b6e3bb592ca.mp3"}},{"text":"꽁꽁","meaning":"坚硬地，硬实地，硬邦邦地","explanation":"꽁꽁：坚硬地，硬实地，硬邦邦地。","readings":[{"term":"꽁꽁","audio":"/audio/5e59b23064fb27d12e74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38208","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽁꽁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽁꽁","audio":"/audio/5e59b23064fb27d12e74.mp3"}},{"text":"얼었어.","meaning":"冻僵","explanation":"얼다：冻僵；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"얼다","audio":"/audio/483a31bad3d8768e32a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66572","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼었어","audio":"/audio/ba651ffc7e9e3db22574.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c54dd45d274b6e46","term":"밖","zh":"外面，外边","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3","entryId":"17878","definition":"不被某个包围的空间。","pronunciation":["박"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"身体感觉到的气温低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]},{"id":"27d4fa6af704520d","term":"손","zh":"手","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3","entryId":"17608","definition":"位于手腕的末端，用于摸某物或抓某物时使用的肢体中一部分。","pronunciation":["손"]},{"id":"5e59b23064fb27d1","term":"꽁꽁","zh":"坚硬地，硬实地，硬邦邦地","audio":"/audio/5e59b23064fb27d12e74.mp3","entryId":"38208","definition":"水、地面、事物等被冻得很结实的样子。","pronunciation":["꽁꽁"]},{"id":"483a31bad3d8768e","term":"얼다","zh":"冻僵","audio":"/audio/483a31bad3d8768e32a5.mp3","entryId":"66572","definition":"因天气冷而全身或一部分凉得没有感觉。","pronunciation":["얼ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9aa0a4964ce286bcba7e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n68625-1-9-2","ko":"손을 온수에 담그면 금방 녹을 거야.","zh":"把手放在温水中泡一下，很快就能暖过来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"손을","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손을","audio":"/audio/16bcf0abbafd44226097.mp3"}},{"text":"온수에","meaning":"温水","explanation":"온수：温水；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"온수","audio":"/audio/860984d399199abe0126.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68625","senseId":"1","lemma":"온수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"온수에","audio":"/audio/75259c606b59358a2fea.mp3"}},{"text":"담그면","meaning":"浸泡","explanation":"담그다：浸泡；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"ter